1
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:54,000
A stone man?

2
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:58,000
Is he the demon which the stone Goddess
Nuwa left unused has turned into?

3
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:00,000
Who are you?

4
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:04,000
I'm Ma-gu. I didn't mean to trespass
on your territory. Please forgive me

5
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:09,000
Ma-gu?
I've never heard of you

6
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:14,000
My purpose in coming is to take the
furnace to Ping'an Town to save lives

7
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:18,000
Can you give it to me?

8
00:02:21,500 --> 00:02:25,400
I depend on the furnace to survive.
How can I let you have it?

9
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:26,900
If I save those people,
who will save me?

10
00:02:26,900 --> 00:02:30,300
If you sacrifice yourself,
you'll gain a lot

11
00:02:30,300 --> 00:02:34,300
I don't believe you! How do I know
you aren't having me on?

12
00:02:34,300 --> 00:02:37,300
In that case, I'll have to use force!

13
00:03:26,300 --> 00:03:33,300
Let me out!
Let me out...!

14
00:03:54,300 --> 00:04:00,900
Where am I? What happened?
Am I dead?

15
00:04:01,900 --> 00:04:08,300
Relax, your time isn't up yet.
You're just a little injured

16
00:04:08,300 --> 00:04:10,900
You're not having me on?

17
00:04:11,300 --> 00:04:14,300
What happened?
Is this the pill furnace?

18
00:04:15,300 --> 00:04:16,300
Yes!

19
00:04:16,300 --> 00:04:19,900
It is?
Wonderful!

20
00:04:21,100 --> 00:04:25,100
What happened just now? How did I
get hurt? And how come I wasn't aware?

21
00:04:27,300 --> 00:04:30,300
Well, there was an earthquake

22
00:04:30,300 --> 00:04:31,300
Earthquake?

23
00:04:33,900 --> 00:04:35,300
Are you all right?

24
00:04:36,100 --> 00:04:38,100
Are you all right?
You're injured!

25
00:04:38,300 --> 00:04:42,300
Nothing serious.
I'll be all right

26
00:04:42,300 --> 00:04:46,300
Why didn't you tell me
so that I could protect you?

27
00:04:48,300 --> 00:04:50,300
You, protect me?

28
00:04:50,300 --> 00:04:53,900
You doubt I can do it?

29
00:04:54,300 --> 00:04:57,300
Come, hop on

30
00:04:58,300 --> 00:05:03,900
You're injured too. As a man,
I should be the one pulling the cart

31
00:05:04,300 --> 00:05:07,300
-Are you up to it?
-Sure I am!

32
00:05:07,300 --> 00:05:12,300
-Don't force yourself. Let me
-No, let me! I'm strong!

33
00:05:13,300 --> 00:05:17,300
-Don't force yourself...
-Just do as I say and hop on!

34
00:05:26,300 --> 00:05:29,300
Sit tight.
Here I go

35
00:05:30,300 --> 00:05:35,300
We're going down a slope.
It's going faster and faster!

36
00:05:36,300 --> 00:05:39,300
-You've made a mistake...
-Be quiet!

37
00:05:41,300 --> 00:05:44,300
Wait till I show you something.
You'll know why

38
00:05:47,100 --> 00:05:49,100
I haven't finished eating...

39
00:05:55,300 --> 00:05:57,900
This is a temple of the Trio

40
00:05:58,300 --> 00:06:01,900
But it's well-maintained,
unlike the one in Ping'an Town

41
00:06:03,300 --> 00:06:08,300
Maybe they're watched over by the Trio.
That's why they're enjoying longevity

42
00:06:08,300 --> 00:06:10,300
Fortune (fu), Prosperity (lu),
Longevity (shou)?

43
00:06:11,300 --> 00:06:15,300
Wu Fuqi, Mei Shouquan, Wei Delu!

44
00:06:20,300 --> 00:06:22,300
Why are you sighing?

45
00:06:22,300 --> 00:06:28,100
We have Fortune, Prosperity
and Longevity in our names too

46
00:06:29,300 --> 00:06:33,300
But our fates are worlds apart.
Look at them

47
00:06:34,900 --> 00:06:41,300
They're immortals worshipped
by the people in this village

48
00:06:43,300 --> 00:06:47,300
See how magnificent this place is.
And think of us

49
00:06:48,300 --> 00:06:52,300
We're being despised in Ping'an Town.
How can I not sigh?

50
00:06:53,300 --> 00:06:58,300
Come on, wealth and power are
nothing substantive actually

51
00:06:58,300 --> 00:07:04,100
I don't care a hoot about them
either actually

52
00:07:04,300 --> 00:07:09,300
But if I had power, would Shi Yaoqian
have treated me the way he did?

53
00:07:09,300 --> 00:07:11,300
Would I have ended up here?

54
00:07:13,300 --> 00:07:19,100
Spicy Woman is right. Water can keep
a boat afloat as well as overturn it

55
00:07:19,300 --> 00:07:25,100
While power can make one avaricious,
it can also be used to save the people

56
00:07:25,300 --> 00:07:27,300
So why don't you sit the imperial exams?

57
00:07:27,300 --> 00:07:31,300
Given your talent, you shouldn't have
any problem obtaining a position

58
00:07:35,300 --> 00:07:37,300
Of course

59
00:07:40,300 --> 00:07:44,300
You're the reincarnation
of the Constellation of Letters,

60
00:07:44,300 --> 00:07:46,300
who's in charge of literary affairs

61
00:07:46,300 --> 00:07:50,300
Every scholar worships you,
for you're the only one...

62
00:07:50,300 --> 00:07:53,900
who can make their dreams come true!

63
00:07:57,300 --> 00:08:00,300
Who told you all that, Madam?

64
00:08:01,300 --> 00:08:08,300
You did. I was only eight then.
And it was snowing

65
00:08:08,300 --> 00:08:13,900
You and the Stars of Fortune and Longev-
ity gave me this pendant as a memento

66
00:08:19,300 --> 00:08:22,900
Are you over 100 years old, Madam?

67
00:08:23,300 --> 00:08:26,300
I'm 121 years old

68
00:08:28,300 --> 00:08:32,300
What you're talking about
is over a century ago

69
00:08:32,300 --> 00:08:34,900
Master Wei wasn't even born then

70
00:08:35,300 --> 00:08:39,300
Precisely.
I'm not the person you're looking for

71
00:08:41,300 --> 00:08:45,900
I'm not talking about a person but an
immortal. You're the Star of Prosperity

72
00:08:46,300 --> 00:08:53,100
I'm an immortal? That's ridiculous.
Do I resemble him at all?

73
00:08:55,300 --> 00:08:57,300
He's so old and ugly

74
00:09:00,300 --> 00:09:04,300
I mean it'd be his bad luck
if I resembled him

75
00:09:06,300 --> 00:09:08,300
How could you insult yourself?

76
00:09:08,300 --> 00:09:11,300
I'll say this again -

77
00:09:11,300 --> 00:09:16,300
I really am a person
who can't be more ordinary

78
00:09:17,900 --> 00:09:24,900
In my opinion, the longevity you people
enjoy has nothing to do with the Trio

79
00:09:29,300 --> 00:09:34,300
It's because you're away from
the extortion of the officials

80
00:09:34,300 --> 00:09:36,300
That's why you live to a ripe old age

81
00:09:39,300 --> 00:09:42,300
I guess you don't
step out of your village at all

82
00:09:42,300 --> 00:09:45,300
You have no idea what the world
has come to

83
00:09:45,300 --> 00:09:49,900
In my hometown, Ping'an, the temple
of the Trio is forsaken by all

84
00:09:59,300 --> 00:10:01,300
Nobody prays to them anymore

85
00:10:02,300 --> 00:10:07,300
Ignorant young man! How could you
blaspheme against the deities!

86
00:10:08,300 --> 00:10:12,100
-You are the Star of Prosperity!
-I'm not

87
00:10:14,100 --> 00:10:15,100
I'm not

88
00:10:15,100 --> 00:10:17,300
You really aren't
the Star of Prosperity?

89
00:10:17,300 --> 00:10:18,700
No

90
00:10:23,300 --> 00:10:24,900
It can't be

91
00:10:27,300 --> 00:10:31,300
Don't tell me I made a mistake?

92
00:10:32,300 --> 00:10:35,300
Why does she insist
you're the Star of Prosperity?

93
00:10:35,300 --> 00:10:38,300
I don't know.
Look at the Star of Prosperity

94
00:10:38,300 --> 00:10:41,300
He's old and ugly.
Do I look like him at all?

95
00:10:48,300 --> 00:10:49,300
Your Highness...

96
00:10:51,900 --> 00:10:53,900
Did you see flashes of lightning?

97
00:10:55,100 --> 00:10:56,100
No

98
00:10:57,300 --> 00:10:59,300
-No?
-No

99
00:10:59,900 --> 00:11:03,900
This is strange. Why are there
bolts in broad daylight?

100
00:11:25,300 --> 00:11:27,300
What do you think you're doing?

101
00:11:28,300 --> 00:11:32,900
These people are so strange.
They go to bed before night falls

102
00:11:35,300 --> 00:11:37,300
So where should we put up at?

103
00:11:40,100 --> 00:11:43,100
There's a man over there.
Go and ask him

104
00:11:45,300 --> 00:11:47,300
Excuse me...

105
00:11:48,900 --> 00:11:50,900
What do you want?

106
00:11:54,300 --> 00:11:56,300
I've seen you before!

107
00:11:56,900 --> 00:11:59,900
You've made a mistake.
I've never seen you before

108
00:12:01,300 --> 00:12:04,300
Have you become bonkers too
like the old lady?

109
00:12:04,300 --> 00:12:07,100
I really find him familiar

110
00:12:09,300 --> 00:12:12,300
Uncle, is there any inn around?

111
00:12:14,300 --> 00:12:16,900
Are you a guest of
the Village of Longevity?

112
00:12:18,300 --> 00:12:21,300
Yes, we are

113
00:12:21,300 --> 00:12:25,300
May I ask whether you're a resident
of the Village of Longevity?

114
00:12:26,300 --> 00:12:27,300
Yes

115
00:12:28,300 --> 00:12:32,300
I thought all the people here were
old folks? You don't look old to me

116
00:12:35,300 --> 00:12:40,300
I wasn't born here. I used to be
a hunter in the neighbouring village

117
00:12:40,300 --> 00:12:44,900
Once I broke a leg while hunting.
I was saved by the old folks here

118
00:12:44,900 --> 00:12:46,900
I stayed on after that

119
00:12:48,300 --> 00:12:53,900
I guess this is your first time here.
There isn't any inn around

120
00:12:54,300 --> 00:12:57,300
If you don't mind,
you can put up at my place

121
00:12:58,300 --> 00:13:02,300
Thanks for the offer,
but how can we impose on you?

122
00:13:02,300 --> 00:13:05,900
I didn't expect the old folks
to turn in so early...

123
00:13:07,300 --> 00:13:09,300
Come with me

124
00:13:27,300 --> 00:13:33,300
Please make do with such a small
place. You'll take this room

125
00:13:36,300 --> 00:13:38,300
You come with me

126
00:13:41,300 --> 00:13:44,900
I'd prefer to be with my wife

127
00:13:44,900 --> 00:13:46,900
You're husband and wife?

128
00:13:47,300 --> 00:13:48,300
Of course

129
00:13:50,300 --> 00:13:54,300
To be honest with you,
we just got married

130
00:13:55,300 --> 00:13:59,900
You just did?
Congratulations

131
00:14:01,300 --> 00:14:06,100
How should we address you, sir?

132
00:14:06,300 --> 00:14:10,300
I'm a hunter and
my name is Bao (Leopard)

133
00:14:11,300 --> 00:14:13,300
We'll call you Master Bao then

134
00:14:14,300 --> 00:14:18,300
No need to be so formal.
Just let me know if you need anything

135
00:14:20,300 --> 00:14:22,300
You have the bed

136
00:14:23,300 --> 00:14:29,300
I'll just sleep on the floor here

137
00:14:31,300 --> 00:14:37,300
If you need anything, just knock
three times and I'll get up. All right?

138
00:14:38,300 --> 00:14:40,300
Sorry to make you sleep on the floor

139
00:14:40,300 --> 00:14:46,900
It's all right. This place is shabby.
Bear with it for the time being

140
00:14:47,300 --> 00:14:50,900
Once we reach the Capital,
you won't have to suffer anymore

141
00:14:51,300 --> 00:14:54,900
This is heaven compared to the desert

142
00:14:57,300 --> 00:15:00,300
Turn in first.
I'll find you a carriage tomorrow

143
00:15:00,300 --> 00:15:02,300
They're not husband and wife

144
00:15:11,300 --> 00:15:13,300
You got up early

145
00:15:14,300 --> 00:15:17,900
-Where's Brother Wei?
-He's gone to find a carriage

146
00:15:17,900 --> 00:15:19,300
Find a carriage?

147
00:15:21,300 --> 00:15:22,900
Why?

148
00:15:22,900 --> 00:15:26,300
He still has no idea where he is

149
00:15:26,300 --> 00:15:30,300
This place is so remote.
Would there be any carriage around?

150
00:15:30,300 --> 00:15:36,100
You're right. Do you intend to
stay here for the rest of your life?

151
00:15:40,300 --> 00:15:44,900
It's all right if you don't feel like
talking about it. Forget what I asked

152
00:15:47,300 --> 00:15:50,900
I suppose you know why the people here
live to a ripe old age

153
00:15:53,300 --> 00:15:55,300
Of course I do

154
00:15:55,300 --> 00:15:57,300
What's the reason?

155
00:15:57,300 --> 00:16:00,900
It's because of the Youth Spring

156
00:16:01,300 --> 00:16:02,900
Youth Spring?

157
00:16:02,900 --> 00:16:04,900
Shall I take you there?

158
00:16:04,900 --> 00:16:09,300
You can collect some of it and
take it home for your parents

159
00:16:09,300 --> 00:16:10,300
All right

160
00:16:10,300 --> 00:16:12,300
It's up on the mountain

161
00:16:28,900 --> 00:16:30,300
Up ahead

162
00:16:32,300 --> 00:16:35,300
That's the Youth spring

163
00:16:37,300 --> 00:16:40,900
It's in the yard.
Go and see for yourself

164
00:16:46,300 --> 00:16:48,300
How could there be any spring here?

165
00:16:54,300 --> 00:16:55,900
What do you want?

166
00:16:57,300 --> 00:17:00,300
-Where's the spring?
-I'm the "spring" you're looking for

167
00:17:02,300 --> 00:17:04,300
Stay where you are!

168
00:17:05,300 --> 00:17:08,300
Let's not waste any time, beauty!

169
00:17:08,300 --> 00:17:10,300
What impertinence!
Out of my way!

170
00:17:13,300 --> 00:17:15,900
What's the hurry to leave?

171
00:17:15,900 --> 00:17:17,900
What do you want?!

172
00:17:18,300 --> 00:17:22,900
You're too pretty for me to resist.
I can tell you're not husband and wife

173
00:17:22,900 --> 00:17:26,300
Let me be honest with you -
I'm not a hunter

174
00:17:26,300 --> 00:17:30,300
I was convicted for rape and
am hiding here from the authorities

175
00:17:31,300 --> 00:17:34,100
I'll be good to you, beauty!

176
00:17:34,100 --> 00:17:38,300
Do you know who I am? You'll be
sorry for this! Get away from me!

177
00:17:39,300 --> 00:17:42,300
Get away from me...!

178
00:17:50,100 --> 00:17:51,100
Stop it!

179
00:17:54,180 --> 00:17:56,180
-Stay where you are!
-Let her go!

180
00:17:56,180 --> 00:17:58,180
Come nearer and I'll break her neck!

181
00:18:34,300 --> 00:18:36,300
Kill me!

182
00:18:36,300 --> 00:18:38,300
Run, Your Highness!

183
00:18:38,300 --> 00:18:39,300
Help!

184
00:18:39,300 --> 00:18:41,300
How dare you fool me!

185
00:18:42,300 --> 00:18:43,900
Let Her Highness go!

186
00:18:45,300 --> 00:18:47,300
Stop it!

187
00:18:48,300 --> 00:18:49,900
Run, Your Highness!

188
00:18:51,300 --> 00:18:52,900
Run!

189
00:18:56,300 --> 00:18:59,100
Help...!

190
00:19:00,300 --> 00:19:05,300
Help, old sirs and madams!
They're trying to silence me!

191
00:19:05,300 --> 00:19:07,300
-Are you all right?
-Yes

192
00:19:07,300 --> 00:19:09,900
They're trying to silence me...

193
00:19:10,300 --> 00:19:12,300
Don't you malign us!

194
00:19:12,300 --> 00:19:14,900
They're not husband and wife!

195
00:19:15,300 --> 00:19:18,900
I found out their relationship
since they put up at my place,

196
00:19:18,900 --> 00:19:20,900
so they tried to silence me!

197
00:19:21,300 --> 00:19:24,300
How dare you malign me!

198
00:19:24,300 --> 00:19:27,300
Do you dare say you're
husband and wife?

199
00:19:27,300 --> 00:19:30,900
Indeed she and I
aren't a married couple

200
00:19:31,300 --> 00:19:34,900
But we have our reasons
for hiding our identities

201
00:19:35,300 --> 00:19:41,900
They're not married yet they
shared a room. It's appalling!

202
00:19:42,300 --> 00:19:45,300
What did I tell you?
I didn't accuse them wrongly

203
00:19:46,300 --> 00:19:49,300
This is absurd!

204
00:19:51,300 --> 00:19:54,900
It's the custom that
an adulterous pair be drowned!

205
00:19:55,300 --> 00:19:59,300
Drown them...!

206
00:20:00,300 --> 00:20:01,900
Let me out!

207
00:20:05,300 --> 00:20:07,900
Let me out...!

208
00:20:11,300 --> 00:20:13,300
Let them go!

209
00:20:13,300 --> 00:20:16,900
They should be drowned
for committing adultery

210
00:20:17,300 --> 00:20:20,300
What nonsense!
Do you know who he is?

211
00:20:20,300 --> 00:20:24,300
He's our benefactor,
the Star of Prosperity!

212
00:20:33,300 --> 00:20:35,300
Lower...
That's right

213
00:20:35,300 --> 00:20:41,300
You have good judgement, Madam.
Indeed I'm the Star of Prosperity

214
00:20:41,300 --> 00:20:47,300
My purpose in coming to the mortal world
is to help Princess Ruining

215
00:20:48,300 --> 00:20:54,300
Quickly get everyone to go on
their knees to greet Her Highness

216
00:20:55,100 --> 00:20:57,100
Put me back in an upright position

217
00:20:58,300 --> 00:21:00,300
-Here I go
-Sure

218
00:21:02,300 --> 00:21:07,300
Everyone, this is Princess Ruining.
Let's go on our knees to greet her!

219
00:21:07,300 --> 00:21:09,300
How can you take his word for it?

220
00:21:09,300 --> 00:21:13,900
She has to be Princess Ruining.
No doubt about it!

221
00:21:14,300 --> 00:21:19,900
You have my word
as the head of the village

222
00:21:20,300 --> 00:21:26,300
Over 100 years ago, when I was eight,
I met the Star of Prosperity personally

223
00:21:26,300 --> 00:21:29,900
He bestowed Fortune and Longevity
on us

224
00:21:30,300 --> 00:21:34,900
Since he said she's Princess Ruining,
she has to be Princess Ruining

225
00:21:35,300 --> 00:21:38,100
Set them free, quick!

226
00:21:39,300 --> 00:21:44,900
Hurry, greet Her Highness!
Come on!

227
00:21:45,300 --> 00:21:47,300
-Are you all right, Your Highness?
-Yes

228
00:21:50,300 --> 00:21:53,300
Please rise, everyone

229
00:22:05,300 --> 00:22:09,300
Trying to run away, you lecher?

230
00:22:12,300 --> 00:22:15,300
This fellow maligned me just now

231
00:22:16,300 --> 00:22:20,300
He even tried to take liberties with
Her Highness. What should we do with him?

232
00:22:21,300 --> 00:22:25,300
How dare he bully Her Highness!
Let's drown him!

233
00:22:25,900 --> 00:22:28,300
Mercy...!

234
00:22:29,300 --> 00:22:31,900
Mercy...!

235
00:22:32,300 --> 00:22:39,300
Your Highness, please let me off...!
I won't do it again...!

236
00:22:40,300 --> 00:22:44,300
Mercy, Your Highness!
Mercy...!

237
00:22:44,300 --> 00:22:47,300
Do you think we should
spare his life?

238
00:22:47,300 --> 00:22:52,300
He may have done many evils,
but one should forgive and forget

239
00:22:52,300 --> 00:22:55,900
Let's be merciful and
give him another chance

240
00:22:56,300 --> 00:22:58,300
All right.
Let him out

241
00:23:00,300 --> 00:23:04,300
It was the Star of Prosperity
who pleaded for mercy for you

242
00:23:04,300 --> 00:23:08,300
Make sure you turn over a new leaf
or we won't let you off next time!

243
00:23:08,300 --> 00:23:09,900
That's right!

244
00:23:11,300 --> 00:23:15,300
Thank you for sparing my life,
Star of Prosperity

245
00:23:15,300 --> 00:23:19,300
I won't do evil again...

246
00:23:19,300 --> 00:23:24,300
Let's go before
he recovers from shock

247
00:23:42,300 --> 00:23:45,100
Faster!
It's heavy!

248
00:23:47,300 --> 00:23:50,300
Go faster!

249
00:23:51,300 --> 00:23:53,100
Faster!

250
00:23:56,300 --> 00:24:00,900
You left without permission and now
you still have the guts to come back?

251
00:24:01,300 --> 00:24:04,900
We had our reason for leaving

252
00:24:05,300 --> 00:24:11,300
I don't care. It's the Marquis' order
that nobody is to leave the town

253
00:24:11,300 --> 00:24:13,300
And that includes you, Ma Ruyi

254
00:24:13,300 --> 00:24:18,900
Even if you're a constable,
I have to do my job and arrest you

255
00:24:18,900 --> 00:24:20,900
Men, take them to the yamen!

256
00:24:21,300 --> 00:24:22,300
Hold it!

257
00:24:22,300 --> 00:24:24,300
Get them!

258
00:24:24,300 --> 00:24:25,900
Shut up!

259
00:24:26,300 --> 00:24:31,300
You just want to arrest us
to please the Marquis

260
00:24:31,300 --> 00:24:34,300
Perform your duty indeed!
Bah!

261
00:24:35,300 --> 00:24:37,300
What impertinence!

262
00:24:37,900 --> 00:24:39,900
Seize them!

263
00:24:41,300 --> 00:24:46,300
Simmer down. Don't get so worked up.
Come and have a look at this

264
00:24:46,300 --> 00:24:51,300
This is the legendary pill furnace
which Goddess Nuwa used

265
00:24:51,300 --> 00:24:55,300
We'll be able to
produce drugs in it,

266
00:24:56,300 --> 00:25:00,300
and the people of Ping'an Town
will be saved!

267
00:25:00,300 --> 00:25:06,300
We left Ping'an Town not because
we were afraid of death or selfish

268
00:25:06,300 --> 00:25:11,300
Our purpose was to find this furnace.
We had everyone's interests at heart

269
00:25:12,300 --> 00:25:15,300
You, the invalid, are telling me
this is a pill furnace?

270
00:25:15,300 --> 00:25:17,300
Why should I lie to you?

271
00:25:17,300 --> 00:25:20,300
Are you just having me on?

272
00:25:20,300 --> 00:25:24,300
Don't waste your breath. Since he
doesn't believe us, I'll finish them off

273
00:25:24,300 --> 00:25:27,300
I'll have no problem doing that
given my skills

274
00:25:28,300 --> 00:25:32,300
I may not trust him, but I
certainly trust you, Constable Ma

275
00:25:32,300 --> 00:25:35,300
But how can you prove
this is a pill furnace?

276
00:25:35,300 --> 00:25:38,900
Give me three days!

277
00:25:39,300 --> 00:25:44,900
If I can't produce any drugs
to save the people of Ping'an,

278
00:25:44,900 --> 00:25:46,900
I'll be at your disposal!

279
00:25:47,300 --> 00:25:52,900
Fine! If you fail to make any drugs,
your whole family will be beheaded!

280
00:25:55,300 --> 00:25:57,300
Isn't that too heavy a punishment?

281
00:25:58,300 --> 00:25:59,900
Shou is back!

282
00:25:59,900 --> 00:26:03,300
Mother, I'm back!
Sorry to have worried you

283
00:26:03,300 --> 00:26:04,300
Get up...

284
00:26:05,300 --> 00:26:10,300
I've accomplished my task
and brought the pill furnace back

285
00:26:12,300 --> 00:26:14,900
I'm glad you're all right

286
00:26:15,300 --> 00:26:19,300
You have no idea
how worried I was about you

287
00:26:19,300 --> 00:26:21,900
I'm sorry, Mother!

288
00:26:23,300 --> 00:26:27,300
Don't ever make me so worried again

289
00:26:29,300 --> 00:26:33,300
Can the furnace really make drugs?

290
00:26:34,300 --> 00:26:37,900
Miss Ma can't be wrong.
I believe her

291
00:26:38,300 --> 00:26:42,300
There's hope for Jiujin!
She can be saved!

292
00:26:42,300 --> 00:26:44,300
Now you're being concerned

293
00:26:44,300 --> 00:26:48,300
When she was healthy,
you didn't care about her at all

294
00:26:49,300 --> 00:26:56,300
I admit that I was too strict
with her, but I meant her well

295
00:26:57,300 --> 00:27:02,900
Let's let bygones be bygones. When I've
cured Jiujin, you must be good to her

296
00:27:02,900 --> 00:27:05,900
-I will
-Make sure you keep your word

297
00:27:06,300 --> 00:27:11,300
Certainly.
But are you confident of curing her?

298
00:27:11,300 --> 00:27:12,300
Of course

299
00:27:14,300 --> 00:27:18,900
This Manual of Deity of Medicine
was found in the furnace

300
00:27:19,300 --> 00:27:23,900
If we follow the instructions on how
to make drugs, we'll succeed for sure!

301
00:27:24,300 --> 00:27:27,300
The plague will soon be over!

302
00:27:28,300 --> 00:27:30,900
We're going to be rich!

303
00:27:32,300 --> 00:27:35,900
If we sell the drugs at a high price,
we'll earn a fortune!

304
00:27:38,300 --> 00:27:41,300
Don't even think of making money
out of this!

305
00:27:41,300 --> 00:27:46,300
The furnace is meant to save
the people of Ping'an Town

306
00:27:46,300 --> 00:27:50,300
I will not take a cent from anyone

307
00:27:51,300 --> 00:27:55,900
So long as the people can be saved,
I'll be content! Understand?

308
00:27:57,300 --> 00:28:01,300
More woods...
Make the fire bigger

309
00:28:15,300 --> 00:28:18,300
Can the drugs really cure us of
the plague?

310
00:28:18,300 --> 00:28:22,300
Of course they can.
It's written in the manual

311
00:28:25,300 --> 00:28:30,900
I don't understand Shou at all. He's
giving up a good chance to make money

312
00:28:32,300 --> 00:28:36,300
There goes my opportunity
to strike it rich...

313
00:28:37,300 --> 00:28:40,300
Burn it up!

314
00:28:42,300 --> 00:28:44,300
Careful, Mother!

315
00:28:48,900 --> 00:28:53,300
Mother, you're here at last.
Talk some sense into Shou

316
00:28:53,300 --> 00:28:57,300
Get him to collect at least a token sum.
We're slogging our guts out

317
00:28:57,300 --> 00:29:03,300
Don't be so money-minded. Some things
cannot be bought with money

318
00:29:03,300 --> 00:29:06,300
It's meaningful to do something
for our town

319
00:29:07,300 --> 00:29:11,900
Can "meaningful" fill our stomachs?

320
00:29:13,300 --> 00:29:15,900
This is terrible!

321
00:29:16,300 --> 00:29:21,300
Shou, Datou is suffering
from the plague too!

322
00:29:21,300 --> 00:29:23,300
What? He's got it too?

323
00:29:23,900 --> 00:29:26,300
You must save him!

324
00:29:26,300 --> 00:29:30,900
Calm down. Once my drugs are ready,
everyone will be saved

325
00:29:30,900 --> 00:29:32,900
What if you fail?

326
00:29:33,300 --> 00:29:34,900
What do you want?

327
00:29:34,900 --> 00:29:37,900
I just want to remind you
of the deadline

328
00:29:38,300 --> 00:29:42,300
Today is only the first day.
Why are you so anxious?

329
00:29:42,300 --> 00:29:45,900
If you like telling time so much,
go be a rooster!

330
00:29:47,300 --> 00:29:51,300
Be quiet!
I have your interests at heart!

331
00:29:51,300 --> 00:29:54,300
Indeed! You can't be more wicked!
We all know your purpose in coming

332
00:29:56,300 --> 00:30:02,300
You're trying to delay my schedule
so I can't produce the drugs on time

333
00:30:03,300 --> 00:30:06,300
In that case,
I have nothing more to say

334
00:30:06,300 --> 00:30:10,900
Just remember if you fail your task,
everyone in your family will have to die!

335
00:30:10,900 --> 00:30:11,900
Let's go!

336
00:30:13,300 --> 00:30:16,900
Why doesn't he get the plague at all?

337
00:30:17,300 --> 00:30:19,300
He will sooner or later!

338
00:30:19,300 --> 00:30:23,300
And when he comes to us for the drugs,
we'll sell them to him at a high price!

339
00:30:24,300 --> 00:30:28,300
He may not be a good man,
but it's terrible to get the plague

340
00:30:28,300 --> 00:30:30,300
Let's not curse him

341
00:30:35,100 --> 00:30:37,100
We've reached the Capital at last

342
00:30:37,300 --> 00:30:40,300
Why do you sound a little sad?

343
00:30:41,300 --> 00:30:43,300
I guess I'm tired

344
00:30:43,900 --> 00:30:46,300
Let's hurry.
I really miss my father

345
00:30:46,300 --> 00:30:52,100
Once you step into the Palace, I can't
have private moments with you anymore

346
00:30:52,100 --> 00:30:53,100
Why?

347
00:30:54,300 --> 00:30:56,900
Isn't that Her Highness?
Go and inform Chief

348
00:30:57,300 --> 00:31:00,300
The Capital is much livelier
than Ping'an Town

349
00:31:01,900 --> 00:31:06,300
Ping'an Town may be small, but
the people there are kind and warm

350
00:31:06,300 --> 00:31:12,300
You're right. All the men in Ping'an
Town are gentlemanly and faithful

351
00:31:12,300 --> 00:31:14,300
I'm a living example

352
00:31:15,300 --> 00:31:17,900
There's always someone stronger

353
00:31:18,300 --> 00:31:24,300
You're a fine man, Master Wei.
It's just that you aren't modest at all

354
00:31:25,300 --> 00:31:28,300
If one is too modest,
one becomes hypocritical

355
00:31:28,300 --> 00:31:33,300
Don't say I didn't remind you. There
are many conflicts and struggles here

356
00:31:33,300 --> 00:31:38,300
If you want to carve out a career,
you'll have to watch your tongue

357
00:31:38,300 --> 00:31:41,900
I've told you many times.
Why won't you heed my advice?

358
00:31:41,900 --> 00:31:43,900
Are you listening?

359
00:31:46,300 --> 00:31:47,900
Wei Delu!

360
00:31:49,300 --> 00:31:52,300
Wei Delu!

361
00:31:52,300 --> 00:31:54,300
Make way...!

362
00:31:55,300 --> 00:31:57,300
Our respects to Your Highness!

363
00:31:57,300 --> 00:32:02,900
You're back at last, Your Highness!
Let's return to the Palace, quick!

364
00:32:04,300 --> 00:32:07,100
No. I must wait for Master Wei

365
00:32:07,100 --> 00:32:12,300
His Majesty misses you so much that
he's ill. Let's go back to the Palace

366
00:32:12,300 --> 00:32:13,300
But...

367
00:32:14,300 --> 00:32:19,300
You can always send for him later.
Go and see His Majesty first, quick!

368
00:32:21,300 --> 00:32:23,300
Back to the Palace

369
00:32:29,900 --> 00:32:31,300
Your Highness!

370
00:32:31,300 --> 00:32:32,300
Who are you?

371
00:32:35,300 --> 00:32:37,300
I'm a friend of Her Highness

372
00:32:38,300 --> 00:32:42,900
She wouldn't know someone like you.
Now leave!

373
00:32:43,300 --> 00:32:47,300
I really am a friend of hers.
I went to buy haw candy for her

374
00:32:48,300 --> 00:32:50,300
Get lost!

375
00:32:53,300 --> 00:32:55,300
You haven't paid for the haw candy

376
00:32:56,300 --> 00:32:58,300
It's meant for Her Highness

377
00:32:58,300 --> 00:33:03,900
Sure! His Majesty will collect it.
If you have no money, don't buy it!

378
00:33:07,100 --> 00:33:10,300
You don't know how terrible he was,
Father!

379
00:33:10,300 --> 00:33:14,300
When we were in Ping'an Town, he lost
in a bet but refused to admit defeat

380
00:33:14,300 --> 00:33:17,300
He continued to confine me
to his abode!

381
00:33:17,300 --> 00:33:18,300
Really?

382
00:33:18,300 --> 00:33:24,300
I went through a lot to escape and
nearly lost my life on my way back!

383
00:33:24,300 --> 00:33:29,300
My poor daughter, you've suffered.
I'll see that justice is done

384
00:33:31,300 --> 00:33:33,300
Your Highness, you're back

385
00:33:33,300 --> 00:33:35,300
My respects to Your Majesty

386
00:33:35,300 --> 00:33:40,900
Why did you confine the princess
and wouldn't let her come back?

387
00:33:41,300 --> 00:33:45,900
It was to stop the plague from spreading
that I forbade anybody from...

388
00:33:45,900 --> 00:33:47,900
leaving or entering Ping'an Town

389
00:33:48,300 --> 00:33:53,300
And I only confined Her Highness
out of concern for her safety

390
00:33:53,300 --> 00:33:56,900
Had anything happened to her, I wouldn't
have been able to answer for it

391
00:33:57,300 --> 00:34:02,300
He has a point.
Could you have misunderstood him?

392
00:34:02,300 --> 00:34:06,300
I don't care!
You must punish him severely!

393
00:34:07,300 --> 00:34:08,300
All right

394
00:34:09,300 --> 00:34:15,900
You knew I have only one daughter
yet you still bullied her!

395
00:34:16,300 --> 00:34:18,300
Men! Have him beheaded!

396
00:34:19,300 --> 00:34:22,300
Father, he doesn't deserve death

397
00:34:22,900 --> 00:34:24,900
So you've forgiven him?

398
00:34:26,300 --> 00:34:28,300
I won't have to put him to death?

399
00:34:28,300 --> 00:34:30,300
Thank you, Your Highness

400
00:34:33,300 --> 00:34:37,300
Though I won't put you to death,
you must still be punished

401
00:34:37,300 --> 00:34:42,900
I want you to keep her company
and make her happy every day

402
00:34:42,900 --> 00:34:43,900
Yes, Your Majesty

403
00:35:18,300 --> 00:35:21,300
Which piece of work do you like, sir?

404
00:35:21,300 --> 00:35:28,300
I have all styles of calligraphy here.
I'll give you a discount

405
00:35:29,300 --> 00:35:32,300
You call this calligraphy?

406
00:35:33,900 --> 00:35:35,900
What do you mean?

407
00:35:35,900 --> 00:35:41,300
In calligraphy, you need to do it at one
go and give people an imposing impression

408
00:35:42,300 --> 00:35:45,300
All these works don't display
the essence of it

409
00:35:46,300 --> 00:35:51,300
I'm running this stall
for a living

410
00:35:51,300 --> 00:35:54,900
If you're here to buy paintings,
you're most welcome

411
00:35:54,900 --> 00:35:59,300
But if you're here to make trouble,
I won't tolerate that

412
00:35:59,300 --> 00:36:04,900
Practising calligraphy helps one
become more composed and magnanimous

413
00:36:04,900 --> 00:36:08,900
You're so short-tempered. It goes
to show your works are mediocre

414
00:36:08,900 --> 00:36:10,900
It's not worth buying them

415
00:36:11,300 --> 00:36:14,300
Hold it!
You sound so proud

416
00:36:14,300 --> 00:36:19,900
I should think you have
a flair for calligraphy

417
00:36:20,300 --> 00:36:22,900
Please give me some guidance

418
00:36:26,300 --> 00:36:27,300
Sir

419
00:36:53,300 --> 00:37:00,300
You're indeed a rare talent!
I can't hold a candle to you at all!

420
00:37:03,100 --> 00:37:08,100
"Ruining"? That's the Princess' name.
It's quite well written

421
00:37:08,100 --> 00:37:10,100
I'll buy it

422
00:37:11,300 --> 00:37:13,300
Who are you?

423
00:37:13,300 --> 00:37:15,900
You mean you don't know who I am?

424
00:37:18,300 --> 00:37:22,300
I'm one of the renowned dealers
of art works in the Capital

425
00:37:22,300 --> 00:37:26,900
Your calligraphy is quite good.
Name the price. I'll take it

426
00:37:27,300 --> 00:37:32,300
You look loaded and arrogant,
and you reek of money

427
00:37:32,300 --> 00:37:36,300
If you buy this, it'll be a disgrace
to the two characters on it

428
00:37:36,300 --> 00:37:39,900
I'd rather tear it up than
sell it to you!

429
00:37:41,300 --> 00:37:43,300
You don't know what's good for you!

430
00:37:44,300 --> 00:37:46,900
Look who's talking

431
00:37:47,300 --> 00:37:52,300
Tao Yuanming set a good example by not
bowing low for a paltry sum of money

432
00:37:52,300 --> 00:37:56,900
You think you can buy this
just because you're rich? Fat hope!

433
00:37:57,300 --> 00:37:59,300
You're tired of living!

434
00:37:59,300 --> 00:38:02,900
Don't get so worked up or you might
drive yourself to your grave

435
00:38:08,300 --> 00:38:09,900
Master Wei!

436
00:38:12,300 --> 00:38:14,300
I had such a hard time
looking for you

437
00:38:14,300 --> 00:38:17,300
So did I.
Where's Her Highness?

438
00:38:17,300 --> 00:38:22,300
In the Palace. She asked me to
settle you down in Huguo Temple

439
00:38:22,300 --> 00:38:25,300
Huguo Temple?
Will she be there?

440
00:38:25,300 --> 00:38:28,300
She said she'd visit you
when she had the time

441
00:38:28,300 --> 00:38:30,300
Where is Huguo Temple?

442
00:38:30,300 --> 00:38:33,100
I'll take you there now

443
00:38:33,300 --> 00:38:35,900
Let's go then

444
00:38:41,700 --> 00:38:44,100
Miss Ma, give me a hand

445
00:38:48,300 --> 00:38:53,100
I should think the medicine
will be ready in three days

446
00:38:53,300 --> 00:38:57,300
This is the most critical moment. Watch
the fire or our effort will go to waste

447
00:38:57,300 --> 00:38:58,300
I will

448
00:39:04,300 --> 00:39:07,300
Don't tell me it's going to rain

449
00:39:11,300 --> 00:39:15,300
Never mind about us, Mother.
Go home first

450
00:39:28,100 --> 00:39:31,100
-What's going on?
-This isn't normal at all

451
00:40:15,300 --> 00:40:16,300
Miss Ma!

452
00:40:53,100 --> 00:40:54,100
God of Plague?!

453
00:41:59,300 --> 00:42:01,700
Shou!

454
00:42:04,100 --> 00:42:06,300
Wake up, Shou!

455
00:42:06,300 --> 00:42:08,900
Shou, wake up!

456
00:42:13,300 --> 00:42:15,900
Are you hurt?

457
00:42:22,300 --> 00:42:28,900
I don't think I'll make it this time.
You saved me again...

458
00:42:30,300 --> 00:42:32,300
I don't think I can ever repay you

459
00:42:34,300 --> 00:42:36,300
Don't start talking like that

460
00:42:37,300 --> 00:42:42,300
Let me finish what I have to say,
Ruyi

461
00:42:43,300 --> 00:42:48,300
You must protect the furnace
no matter what

462
00:42:49,300 --> 00:42:53,300
Quickly finish making the drugs
and save the people

463
00:42:55,100 --> 00:43:00,900
There's something I must tell you...

464
00:43:05,300 --> 00:43:09,300
All along, I've been...

465
00:43:09,300 --> 00:43:13,300
fond of you, do you know that?

466
00:43:15,300 --> 00:43:21,900
But I just don't have
the good fortune of marrying you

467
00:43:25,300 --> 00:43:29,300
If we get to meet again
in our next lives,

468
00:43:30,300 --> 00:43:32,900
I must marry you

469
00:43:34,300 --> 00:43:37,300
All right...

470
00:43:54,300 --> 00:43:57,300
Shou!

471
00:43:58,300 --> 00:44:03,700
Wake up, Shou!
Shou!

472
00:44:38,300 --> 00:44:40,300
Subtitled by S Lin


